snippet:
One year ago, I started this strategy portfolio. Initially, the portfolio run 7 strategies for the first 3 months. Then the #wsot run by
@wsot_com
started. At that point I changed the portfolio to a rather broader approach. More strategies and trading the US Large Cap universe - only highly liquid US stocks.  The portfolio got second in the overall ranking and 1st in the stock category. Since then the number of strategies increased to over 40 strategies.  Trading long and short Momentum, Mean Reversion Seasonality and Intraday Setups  The monthly statistics always look a bit better then the daily. So you find the daily once in the comments. But all the big players show their stats on monthly data. 😎 I am very much looking forward to the next WSOT starting 1st of July.
